# mm.fonts test target

Exercises the pure font logic on the host: the committed glyph tables against
a small golden set, transparent one-bit composition in both polarities,
monospace measurement, UTF-8 validation, right-edge clipping, and the one-bit
to RGB565 row expander. No display provider is involved.
